{"root":{"data":{"id":"ff7aea9aa2e0","created":1562296690,"text":"Clickhouse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvazykhi0so0","created":1562296701295,"text":"数据结构","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvazyolnhcw0","created":1562296710253,"text":"UInt8, UInt16, UInt32, UInt64, Int8, Int16, Int32, Int64"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvazyytays00","created":1562296732484,"text":"INT前面加U表示unsigned，数字越大表示range越大"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvazzjekptc0","created":1562296777306,"text":"Float32, Float64"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb001xw7ko0","created":1562296817656,"text":"Float32 - float\nFloat64 - double\n单精度、双精度视需求决定"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb02st9yx40","created":1562297032878,"text":"NaN - Not a number\nInf - Infinity\n-Inf - Negative Infinity"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb0609yho00","created":1562297284217,"text":"Decimal"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb0661cesg0","created":1562297296757,"text":"精度Decimal(P, S), Decimal32(S), Decimal64(S), Decimal128(S)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb06q2wcfc0","created":1562297340386,"text":"P - 精度。有效范围：[1:38]，决定可以有多少个十进制数字（包括分数）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb06uddxds0","created":1562297349728,"text":"S - 规模。有效范围：[0：P]，决定数字的小数部分中包含的小数位数。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb07y3i42o0","created":1562297436201,"text":"Boolean Values"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb08338kcg0","created":1562297447069,"text":"UInt8"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb0e2fsa5c0","created":1562297915836,"text":"restricted to the values 0 or 1"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb0emvhets0","created":1562297960321,"text":"String"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb0eruffhc0","created":1562297971141,"text":"不定长，不限制长度\n没有编码的概念，值可以是任意bytes的集合，包括空（null bytes），存取状态一致\n不过如果是TEXT，推荐用UTF-8"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb0fzun6x40","created":1562298066933,"text":"FixedString"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb0g4je3ug0","created":1562298077136,"text":"含有N个字节的固定长度字符串\nA fixed-length string of N bytes (neither characters nor code points). "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3gqd6ilc0","created":1562306587979,"text":"UUID"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3gxhjr680","created":1562306603481,"text":"universally unique identifier (UUID) is a 16-byte number used to identify records"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3hakwztc0","created":1562306631983,"text":"Date"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3hcx1p3k0","created":1562306637070,"text":"A date. Stored in two bytes as the number of days since 1970-01-01 (unsigned)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3hhja8cg0","created":1562306647122,"text":"DateTime"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3hn2nml40","created":1562306659177,"text":"Date with time, The minimal value is output as 0000-00-00 00:00:00"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3hlduw740","created":1562306655501,"text":"Enum8, Enum16"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3ist3e340","created":1562306750024,"text":"存储有限的字符数字对应关系集合\nEnum saves the finite set of pairs of 'string' = integer"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3wxzoy800","created":1562307858405,"text":"Array(T)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3x4fnqm00","created":1562307872431,"text":"数组列，数组中包含的元素类型一致，T即为类型，数组可以是多维数组（但支持性欠佳）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb3x2yap680","created":1562307869204,"text":"AggregateFunction(name, types_of_arguments...)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb3yzz58ps0","created":1562308019454,"text":"表示聚合函数的某个中间状态"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb40fm123k0","created":1562308131854,"text":"Tuple(T1, T2, ...)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb414b6aco0","created":1562308185616,"text":" temporary column grouping，可以存储不同类型的数据"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb41qk73gw0","created":1562308234051,"text":"Nullable(TypeName)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb4269y5u00","created":1562308268260,"text":"表示数据为空时自动为NULL，TypeName是原始数据类型\n如Nullable(Int8)表示数据类型为Int8，当数据为空时自动为NULL\n但TypeName不能时Array(T)和Tuple(T)这样的一组数据，本身必须明确的类型"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5ioj9z940","created":1562312382943,"text":"不是一个单独存在的类型，需要组合使用；\n类似于MySQL中的Default NULL，并且在数据不赋新值自动重写成NULL以维护一致性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb4425nxnk0","created":1562308416022,"text":"Nested(Name1 Type1, Name2 Type2, ...)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb4444le9k0","created":1562308420311,"text":"更类似于嵌套表，可以定义单独的表名和字段类型"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb512502rk0","created":1562311001999,"text":"直接选择嵌套表列信息的时候，返回的是整列的数组\n可以简单地把嵌套数据结构当做是所有列都是相同长度的多列数组\n使用ARRAY_JOIN的时候，才可以获取其嵌套下的单个信息"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb52qx35ls0","created":1562311134305,"text":"特殊类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb52stvars0","created":1562311138464,"text":"Expression：表示Lambda表达式"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb537b8rxs0","created":1562311169989,"text":"Set：Used for the right half of an IN expression."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb54d4jcyo0","created":1562311261008,"text":"Nothing：不可以主动创建，用来表示值不符合预期"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb55gu6bvc0","created":1562311347453,"text":"Domains"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb55v3wj5s0","created":1562311378516,"text":"IPv4 is a domain based on UInt32 type and serves as typed replacement for storing IPv4 values"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5643s2jk0","created":1562311398100,"text":"IPv6 is a domain based on FixedString(16) type and serves as typed replacement for storing IPv6 values"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb578oxug00","created":1562311486451,"text":"引擎","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5hhrk9k00","created":1562312289842,"text":"MergeTree","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5o8i861c0","created":1562312818236,"text":"特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5oafyvoo0","created":1562312822453,"text":"存储的数据按主键排序（可以创建用于快速检索数据的小稀疏索引）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5p1ijd0o0","created":1562312881381,"text":"指定了主键就允许使用分区，提高了性能"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5pit9ehs0","created":1562312919035,"text":"支持数据副本和采样"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5qamzj4g0","created":1562312979605,"text":"子句"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5qebcmy80","created":1562312987609,"text":"ORDER BY 和PRIMARY KEY：默认情况下，主键跟ORDER BY指定的排序键相同，不需要单独指定"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5rbn13c80","created":1562313060149,"text":"SAMPLE BY抽样表达式，要用抽样表达式主键中必须有相关的表达式","note":"如果要用抽样表达式，主键中必须包含这个表达式。例如： SAMPLE BY intHash32(UserID) ORDER BY (CounterID, EventDate, intHash32(UserID)) 。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb66cfuhxk0","created":1562314237354,"text":"SETTINGS"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb66n7ls2o0","created":1562314260800,"text":"index_granularity 索引粒度。即索引中相邻『标记』间的数据行数。默认值，8192 "},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6997pvbc0","created":1562314465424,"text":"数据存储","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb68yr52rk0","created":1562314442654,"text":"数据插入时，会分成数据片段按主键的字典序排序"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6ac1we5k0","created":1562314549967,"text":"clikchouse为每个数据片段创建索引文件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6bz84ic80","created":1562314678774,"text":"索引比全表描述更高效"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6d2mzc2g0","created":1562314764566,"text":"稀疏索引会引起额外的数据读取，每个数据块会多读index_granularity * 2 行额外的数据；8192时并不会降级性能\n稀疏索引可以操作巨量行但表，因为这些索引常驻内存（RAM）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6dczgqs00","created":1562314787089,"text":"clickhouse不要求主键唯一"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb57jbb3cg0","created":1562311509571,"text":"SQL语法","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb57qpwjo00","created":1562311525691,"text":"SELECT查","note":"SELECT [DISTINCT] expr_list\n    [FROM [db.]table | (subquery) | table_function] [FINAL]\n    [SAMPLE sample_coeff]\n    [ARRAY JOIN ...]\n    [GLOBAL] [ANY|ALL] [INNER|LEFT|RIGHT|FULL|CROSS] [OUTER] JOIN (subquery)|table USING columns_list\n    [PREWHERE expr]\n    [WHERE expr]\n    [GROUP BY expr_list] [WITH TOTALS]\n    [HAVING expr]\n    [ORDER BY expr_list]\n    [LIMIT [n, ]m]\n    [UNION ALL ...]\n    [INTO OUTFILE filename]\n    [FORMAT format]\n    [LIMIT [offset_value, ]n BY columns]","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb58xfumpk0","created":1562311618685,"text":"在不使用Distinct，GROUP BY，ORDER BY ，IN， JOIN时，clickhouse的查询内存只需要O（1），上述查询会消耗空间\n尽量不要使用*表示查询全部列，使用场景很小"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5c2rae880","created":1562311865353,"text":"FROM Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5dqlffcw0","created":1562311995605,"text":"在特定引擎下可使用"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5c2ud4340","created":1562311865539,"text":"SAMPLE Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb5dmkeglc0","created":1562311986836,"text":"允许样本查询"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6kd7reu80","created":1562315336140,"text":"SAMPLE k\nSAMPLE n\nSAMPLE k OFFSET m"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb5dkuvyuw0","created":1562311983117,"text":"ARRAY JOIN Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb6lll1qbs0","created":1562315432722,"text":"ARRAY JOIN 不返回空值\nLEFT ARRAY JOIN 返回空值"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6o7zj0m80","created":1562315638215,"text":"AS：Using Aliases"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6prqgbag0","created":1562315759566,"text":"arrayEnumerate"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6pzprpu00","created":1562315776939,"text":"JOIN Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb6qcx0bao0","created":1562315805675,"text":"INNER JOIN (or JOIN)\nLEFT JOIN (or LEFT OUTER JOIN)\nRIGHT JOIN (or RIGHT OUTER JOIN)\nFULL JOIN (or FULL OUTER JOIN)\nCROSS JOIN (or , )","layout_right_offset":{"x":0,"y":0}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6r4z5he00","created":1562315866754,"text":"ALL 如果右表有多条符合的行，都JOIN\nANY 右表有多条显示行，只JOIN第一条\nASOF 表示通过多个区间进行模糊JOIN"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6vjssrk80","created":1562316212479,"text":"语法使用USING"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6vvkeh2w0","created":1562316238092,"text":"ANY LEFT JOIN > ANY INNER JOIN > ALL..."},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb6xo9jdfk0","created":1562316378926,"text":"WHERE和PERWHERE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb6xtviips0","created":1562316391139,"text":"首先只去读PERWHERE表达式中需要的列，然后根据PERWHERE执行的结果读取其他需要的列\nPERWHERE优先级高于WHERE"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7j92tvbk0","created":1562318069880,"text":"GROUP BY Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb7la8pn4g0","created":1562318229141,"text":"非聚合列、非常数都需要为GROUP BY的KEY，除非用ANY，MIN，MAX\nGROUP BY不支持ARRAY类型的列（整列，列中的值还是可以的）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7xi09gzc0","created":1562319186415,"text":"不支持使用列的位置作为参数，GROUP BY 1，2就不被允许"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7n6ltwkw0","created":1562318377956,"text":"LIMIT N BY Clause"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb7nj6xbn40","created":1562318405353,"text":"用来在每一个Colum分组中取最大的N行数据，最多不超过100行"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7og4oago0","created":1562318477050,"text":"HAVING"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7pba34m80","created":1562318544858,"text":"ORDER BY"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb7ph1ekbk0","created":1562318557393,"text":"可以通过NULLS FIRST或NULLS LAST修饰符安排数据和NULL的优先级"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7u4v9g2o0","created":1562318922721,"text":"LIMIT"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb7uadih3k0","created":1562318934709,"text":"LIMIT n, m 用于在查询结果中选择从n行开始的m行数据\n必须配合ORDER BY使用，否则结果可能是任意不确定顺序"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7v2rq9h40","created":1562318996518,"text":"UNION ALL 组合任意数量的查询"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7vkc9j7k0","created":1562319034765,"text":"INTO OUTFILE 将查询结果重定向到子句"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7vz4qkwg0","created":1562319066962,"text":"FORMAT 子句可以指定返回数据的格式¶"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb7zacar7c0","created":1562319326456,"text":"INSERT INTO 增","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb86i64g4o0","created":1562319892046,"text":"INSERT INTO [db.]table [(c1, c2, c3)] VALUES (v11, v12, v13), (v21, v22, v23), ..."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb872q2wu80","created":1562319936789,"text":"不支持其他用于修改数据的查询：UPDATE, DELETE, REPLACE, MERGE, UPSERT, INSERT UPDATE。 \n可以使用 ALTER TABLE ... DROP PARTITION查询来删除一些旧的数据。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb87c2rqjk0","created":1562319957147,"text":"性能建议"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb87ng137s0","created":1562319981893,"text":"数据预先分组，批量写入时Batch尽量大"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb87yboww00","created":1562320005576,"text":"数据总是被实时写入或者写入的数据已经按照时间排序则不会影响性能"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb88mgux8g0","created":1562320058131,"text":"CREATE创建","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb88xhqnf40","created":1562320082130,"text":"CREATE DATABASE"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8ak5y8400","created":1562320209846,"text":"默认值"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8d1n8slk0","created":1562320404625,"text":"默认值需要指定\n默认表达式DEFAULT expr，通过表达式计算默认值并填充\nMATERIALIZED expr，物化表达式\nALIAS expr别名"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8d617q000","created":1562320414177,"text":"如果未指定时会自动设置为当前数值类型的初始值：\n数值类型为零、字符串类型为空字符串、数组类型为空数组、日期类型为‘0000-00-00’以及时间类型为‘0000-00-00 00:00:00’"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8d9277a00","created":1562320420767,"text":"不支持使用NULL作为默认值；不能为nested类型的列设置默认值"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8f9qxmcg0","created":1562320578991,"text":"CREATE VIEW"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8ftp55800","created":1562320622418,"text":"CREATE [MATERIALIZED] VIEW [IF NOT EXISTS] [db.]table_name [TO[db.]name] [ENGINE = engine] [POPULATE] AS SELECT ..."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8g0wa5n40","created":1562320638088,"text":"普通视图：只保存视图的查询，从另一个表读取"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8gadspzc0","created":1562320658738,"text":"物化视图：当将数据写入到物化视图中SELECT子句所指定的表时，插入的数据会通过SELECT子句查询进行转换并将最终结果插入到视图中。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8gsudvqg0","created":1562320698923,"text":"视图看起来和普通的表完全相同，可以通过show tables查看到它们\n视图不能单独删除，删除视图也要使用drop table"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8i9nbvmo0","created":1562320813866,"text":"ALTER","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8inuw9bk0","created":1562320844798,"text":"ALTER TABLE [db].name [ON CLUSTER cluster] ADD|DROP|CLEAR|COMMENT|MODIFY COLUMN ..."},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8iw8k8o00","created":1562320863039,"text":"提供对列的增删改查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8jmw5ouw0","created":1562320921062,"text":"ADD COLUMN 在表中增加新列"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8jugo87k0","created":1562320937540,"text":"DROP COLUMN 删除列"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8jzd9pgw0","created":1562320948218,"text":"CLEAR COLUMN 删除列的值"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8k55kins0","created":1562320960813,"text":"COMMENT COLUMN 为列添加文字描述，文字描述保存在DESCRIBE TABLE中的comment_expression列"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8khl27400","created":1562320987871,"text":"MODIFY COLUMN 修改列的数值类型或是默认表达式"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8ng0b60g0","created":1562321219532,"text":"其他查询","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8njtdkxk0","created":1562321227820,"text":"ATTACH：创建已存在表的映射，类似加载"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8o4elwwo0","created":1562321272639,"text":"CHECK TABLE 判断数据是否被污染，通过比较实际文件大小和预期大小"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8qkpfg800","created":1562321464851,"text":"DESCRIBE TABLE 描述表"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8qvn7p600","created":1562321488661,"text":"DETACH：删映射不删表，让服务器以为表被删列，下次服务器加载仍能通过ATTACH获取表信息和数据 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8sjt32t40","created":1562321619623,"text":"DROP：删库/删表"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8ssydq5c0","created":1562321639534,"text":"EXISTS：判断是否存在"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8sxasvso0","created":1562321648993,"text":"KILL QUERY 杀查询进程"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8tcrprs00","created":1562321682667,"text":"-- Forcibly terminates all queries with the specified query_id:\nKILL QUERY WHERE query_id='2-857d-4a57-9ee0-327da5d60a90'"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8uiftww00","created":1562321773373,"text":"KILL MUTATION杀变化，停止正在变化的库/表，已经产生的变化不会回滚"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8v22k1sg0","created":1562321816106,"text":"OPTIMIZE 优化查询，引擎自动进行优化"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb8w8nt4yw0","created":1562321908816,"text":"OPTIMIZE TABLE [db.]name [ON CLUSTER cluster] [PARTITION partition] [FINAL]"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb8zvorx140","created":1562322194033,"text":"RENAME重命名表"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb91pwx6e00","created":1562322338193,"text":"SET赋值参数：SET param = value"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb987yyyso0","created":1562322847684,"text":"SHOW CREATE TABLE显示建表语句"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb98j0obc80","created":1562322871732,"text":"SHOW DATABASES"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb98p8jcm00","created":1562322885268,"text":"SHOW PROCESSLIST：显示当前运行的查询进程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb999cvlyg0","created":1562322929066,"text":"SHOW TABLES"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb99q97fds0","created":1562322965849,"text":"TRUNCATE 删除一张表的所有数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb99xdkcp40","created":1562322981350,"text":"USE db 选择数据库"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9eby8ctc0","created":1562323326532,"text":"FUNCTION函数","expandState":"expand","note":"函数过多，有些不太常用的没有完全记录，请参阅文档"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb9emf1g4g0","created":1562323349316,"text":"Arithmetic","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb9edp384g0","created":1562323330332,"text":"plus(a, b)或a+b"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9f9aleeo0","created":1562323399113,"text":"minus(a, b)或a-b"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9fh0z0w80","created":1562323415945,"text":"multiply(a,b)或a*b"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9g8l2hig0","created":1562323475934,"text":"divide(a,b)或a/b，结果类型始终是浮点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9i7cvky00","created":1562323629990,"text":"intDiv(a,b)：计算整数数字的商，向下舍入（按绝对值）。 除以零或将最小负数除以-1时抛出异常"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9il7kl0g0","created":1562323660144,"text":"intDivOrZero(a, b)：与'intDiv'的不同之处在于它在除以零或将最小负数除以-1时返回零。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9it14sq80","created":1562323677169,"text":"modulo(a, b), a % b：计算除法后的余数。 如果参数是浮点数，则通过删除小数部分将它们预转换为整数。 \n截断除法用于负数。 除以零或将最小负数除以-1时抛出异常。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9jk97dao0","created":1562323736430,"text":"negate(a), -a\n计算一个数字的 用反转符号计算一个数字。结果始终是带符号的（正负）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9k87kpls0","created":1562323788575,"text":"abs(a)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9kc11p1s0","created":1562323796887,"text":"gcd(a, b)\n返回数字的最大公约数。 除以零或将最小负数除以-1时抛出异常"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9kllfnfc0","created":1562323817711,"text":"lcm(a, b)\n返回数字的最小公倍数。 除以零或将最小负数除以-1时抛出异常。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9l3n69ps0","created":1562323856998,"text":"Compare","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb9l6n9a0w0","created":1562323863533,"text":"比较函数始终返回0或1（UInt8）。\n可以比较以下类型：\nNumbers\nString 和 FixedString\nDate\nDateTime\n以上每个组内的类型均可互相比较，但是对于不同组的类型间不能够进行比较。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9ljhdhxk0","created":1562323891476,"text":"equals, a = b and a == b operator\nnotEquals, a ! operator= b and a <> b\nless, < operator\ngreater, > operator\nlessOrEquals, <= operator\ngreaterOrEquals, >= operator"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9lrl97tc0","created":1562323909125,"text":"Logical逻辑函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb9m2bcag00","created":1562323932470,"text":"逻辑函数可以接受任何数字类型的参数，并返回UInt8类型的0或1。\n0将判定为“false”，任何其他非零的值都将被判定为“true”"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9m9n53ao0","created":1562323948421,"text":"and, AND operator\nor, OR operator\nnot, NOT operator\nxor"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9n4herwo0","created":1562324015555,"text":"Conversion"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvb9nb2sn0g0","created":1562324029908,"text":"clickhouse不支持隐式转化，因此有非常多类型转换函数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9o3o1umg0","created":1562324092143,"text":"Date&Times 时间转换函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvb9op0cwvc0","created":1562324138600,"text":"String 字符串函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdiyuoo2fs0","created":1562553444498,"text":"Searching String字符串搜索"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdj3g9qx280","created":1562553804942,"text":"Replacing String字符串替换"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdj4i3qx9c0","created":1562553887297,"text":"conditional条件函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvdj4rtwlpc0","created":1562553908469,"text":"三元表达：if(cond, then, else), cond ? operator then : else"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdj54nsxu80","created":1562553936399,"text":"多种条件的CASE表达式：multiIf(cond_1, then_1, cond_2, then_2...else)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvdj5zzr4pc0","created":1562554004601,"text":"Mathematical数学函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvdj6z6zfxc0","created":1562554081226,"text":"都返回Float64类型的数值"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvdj7k7r94o0","created":1562554126985,"text":"Rounding取整函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvdj7sdhu4w0","created":1562554144746,"text":"roundDuration(num)和roundAge(num) Yandex.Metrica业务使用，向下舍入到指定集合\nroundDown(num, arr) 将数字向下舍入到指定数组中到元素"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvdjgzdm3680","created":1562554865268,"text":"Array数组函数","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvdnq47auew0","created":1562566865488,"text":"empty 空数组返回1，非空数组返回0"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnqhsbq600","created":1562566895057,"text":"notEmpty 空数组返回0，非空数组返回1"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnrz41rs80","created":1562567011136,"text":"length 数组中的元素个数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdns3yvstc0","created":1562567021707,"text":"emptyArrayUInt8, emptyArrayUInt16, emptyArrayUInt32, emptyArrayUInt64\nemptyArrayInt8, emptyArrayInt16, emptyArrayInt32, emptyArrayInt64\nemptyArrayFloat32, emptyArrayFloat64\nemptyArrayDate, emptyArrayDateTime"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnt3gjkrk0","created":1562567098962,"text":"emptyArrayString 不接受任何参数并返回适当类型的空数组。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnttk2bo80","created":1562567155772,"text":"emptyArrayToSingle 接受一个空数组并返回一个仅包含一个默认值元素的数组。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnunr70gw0","created":1562567221506,"text":"range(N) 返回从0到N-1的数字数组"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnvoa4evk0","created":1562567301015,"text":"array(x1, ...), operator [x1, ...] 使用函数的参数作为数组元素创建一个数组。 参数必须是常量，并且具有最小公共类型的类型"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnvzznhn40","created":1562567326503,"text":"arrayConcat 合并参数中传递的所有数组"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnw9kxve80","created":1562567347381,"text":"arrayElement(arr, n), operator arr[n] 从数组arr中获取索引为n的元素，n必须是整数，数组中的索引从1开始支持负数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnxk0x6qo0","created":1562567448480,"text":"has(arr, elem) 检查'arr'数组是否具有'elem'元素"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnygzkwdc0","created":1562567520232,"text":"hasAll 检查一个数组是否是另一个数组的子集。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnytuw2740","created":1562567548247,"text":"hasAny 检查两个数组是否存在交集。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnz4x1b480","created":1562567572321,"text":"indexOf(arr, x) 返回数组中第一个‘x’元素的索引（从1开始），如果‘x’元素不存在在数组中，则返回0"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdnze3qk9s0","created":1562567592318,"text":"countEqual(arr, x) 返回数组中等于x的元素的个数。相当于arrayCount（elem - > elem = x，arr）。\nNULL值将作为单独的元素值处理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpi34vxsg0","created":1562571878472,"text":"arrayEnumerate(arr) 返回 Array [1, 2, 3, ..., length (arr) ] 此功能通常与ARRAY JOIN一起使用。它允许在应用ARRAY JOIN后为每个数组计算一次"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpiftj2h40","created":1562571906084,"text":"arrayEnumerateUniq(arr, ...) 返回与源数组大小相同的数组，其中每个元素表示与其下标对应的源数组元素在源数组中出现的次数。 \n例如：arrayEnumerateUniq（\\ [10,20,10,30 ]）= \\ [1,1,2,1 ]。使用ARRAY JOIN和数组元素的聚合时，此函数很有用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpj4f0ygw0","created":1562571959626,"text":"arrayPopBack 从数组中删除最后一项"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpjgruc4o0","created":1562571986522,"text":"arrayPopFront 从数组中删除第一项。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpjn1aqd40","created":1562572000154,"text":"arrayPushBack 添加一个元素到数组的末尾"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpjtoqo080","created":1562572014633,"text":"arrayPushFront 将一个元素添加到数组的开头"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpk254ylc0","created":1562572033038,"text":"arrayResize 更改数组的长度。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpk9tw7d40","created":1562572049773,"text":"arraySlice 返回一个子数组，包含从指定位置的指定长度的元素"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpkhb5pzc0","created":1562572066054,"text":"arraySort([func,] arr, ...) 以升序对arr数组的元素进行排序。\n如果指定了func函数，则排序顺序由func函数的调用结果决定。\n如果func接受多个参数，那么arraySort函数也将解析与func函数参数相同数量的数组参数。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpl8glkhs0","created":1562572125156,"text":"arrayReverseSort([func,] arr, ...)\n以降序对arr数组的元素进行排序。如果指定了func函数，则排序顺序由func函数的调用结果决定。\n如果func接受多个参数，那么arrayReverseSort函数也将解析与func函数参数相同数量的数组作为参数。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdplmwgmaw0","created":1562572156590,"text":"arrayUniq(arr, ...)\n如果传递一个参数，则计算数组中不同元素的数量。 如果传递了多个参数，则它计算多个数组中相应位置的不同元素元组的数量。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpm53a0q00","created":1562572196185,"text":"arrayDifference(arr)\n返回一个数组，其中包含所有相邻元素对之间的差值"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpmdqrb3s0","created":1562572215019,"text":"arrayDistinct(arr)返回一个包含所有数组中不同元素的数组"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpmkyksd40","created":1562572230729,"text":"arrayEnumerateDense(arr)返回与源数组大小相同的数组，指示每个元素首次出现在源数组中的位置"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpms9ts7s0","created":1562572246647,"text":"arrayIntersect(arr)\n返回所有数组元素的交集"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpmzaqn8o0","created":1562572261939,"text":"arrayReduce(agg_func, arr1, ...)\n将聚合函数应用于数组并返回其结果。如果聚合函数具有多个参数，则此函数可应用于相同大小的多个数组。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvdpn36f7z40","created":1562572270385,"text":"arrayReverse(arr)\n返回与源数组大小相同的数组，包含反转源数组的所有元素的结果"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmvu1n62so0","created":1563503781863,"text":"Spliting&Merging字符串拆分合并函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw9893bdk0","created":1563504971712,"text":"Others","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmvz0v5x680","created":1563504171990,"text":"Bit位操作函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw30uuesg0","created":1563504485428,"text":"BitMap位图函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmw6cwjs0w0","created":1563504746745,"text":"用于对位图对象进行计算"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw6nokcfc0","created":1563504770206,"text":"位图对象有两种构造方法。\n一个是由聚合函数groupBitmapState构造的，另一个是由Array Object构造的。\n同时还可以将位图对象转化为数组对象。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw6w5f5rk0","created":1563504788640,"text":"Hash函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmw72zvzg80","created":1563504803543,"text":"用于将元素不可逆的伪随机打乱（加密）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw7ra0fyw0","created":1563504856398,"text":"pseudo-random numbers随机数函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmw85n7odk0","created":1563504887671,"text":"使用非加密方式生成伪随机数字"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw8psmwbs0","created":1563504931535,"text":"Encoding编码函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw90b71cw0","created":1563504954425,"text":"UUID函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmw9r6ijc00","created":1563505012915,"text":"URL函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwa30giwo0","created":1563505038670,"text":"IP函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwad8kjzs0","created":1563505060928,"text":"JSON处理函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwaomw2jk0","created":1563505085739,"text":"高阶"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmwar3t5d40","created":1563505091115,"text":"lambda"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwatocy340","created":1563505096711,"text":"arrayMap/arrayFilter/arrayCount/arrayExists/arrayAll"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwj5ioaw00","created":1563505749402,"text":"dict字典函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwk2aijvk0","created":1563505820743,"text":"Functions for working with Yandex.Metrica dictionaries"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwkwrb6uo0","created":1563505887062,"text":"IN函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmwkzhsvvk0","created":1563505893017,"text":"in, notIn, globalIn, globalNotIn"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwlz3psrs0","created":1563505970530,"text":"Nullable处理函数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwt5bbu7s0","created":1563506532600,"text":"其他函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmwt8fwg0g0","created":1563506539407,"text":"磁盘/休眠之类的函数"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwrh6gctc0","created":1563506401698,"text":"ArrayJoin "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvmwrk5sy3k0","created":1563506408189,"text":"这个函数比较嵌合YiDrone的业务场景\n数组中实际值的类型不同，不同的数组列之间存在对应"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwww8gf8w0","created":1563506826292,"text":"Aggregate 聚合函数","layout_right_offset":{"x":24,"y":0}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"bvmwx0v92880","created":1563506836377,"text":"Table Functions表函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"bvn6obycy800","created":1563534366331,"text":"可以通过各种各样的方式引用外部数据源\ne.g. 文件读取/url/mysql/jdbc/odbc"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"bvn7e2bswg00","created":1563536382845,"text":"Dictionaries","layout_right_offset":{"x":-15,"y":13}},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}